oyd Wright Visitor Center","title":"Saturday Afternoon: Decode the Wright Campus","subtitle":"Begin at the official interpretive hub","notes":"Reserve at least a day ahead if you want a guided tour, then report to the GEICO Gift Shop at 840 Johnson Avenue.","short_summary":"The visitor center supplies context for the architecture encountered across campus.","evidence_claim":"Florida Southern identifies the Sharp Family Tourism and Education Center as the interpretive hub for its Wright campus and the departure point for guided walking tours.","source_url":"https://www.flsouthern.edu/frank-lloyd-wright-home","source_title":"Frank Lloyd Wright Visitor Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visitor Center hours are daily 9:30 AM–4:30 PM. Reservations are strongly suggested at least 24 hours before a tour; tour tickets require purchase.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsc-usonian-faculty-house","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Usonian Faculty House","title":"Saturday Afternoon: Examine Wright’s Usonian Idea","subtitle":"Continue beside the Visitor Center","notes":"Check the current admission arrangement before entering and compare the compact house with FSC’s larger academic buildings.","short_summary":"A residential-scale counterpart to the monumental structures elsewhere on campus.","evidence_claim":"Florida Southern says the Tourism and Education Center includes the Usonian Faculty House, a showcase of Frank Lloyd Wright’s residential vision for the campus.","source_url":"https://www.flsouthern.edu/frank-lloyd-wright-home","source_title":"Frank Lloyd Wright Visitor Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official page lists daily Usonian House hours of 10:00 AM–3:00 PM; confirm tour or admission requirements before visiting.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsc-agb-museum-of-art","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Ashley Gibson Barnett Museum of Art","title":"Saturday Gallery Break: Visit the AGB","subtitle":"Explore FSC’s museum near Lake Morton","notes":"Choose a few galleries rather than rushing the entire museum, and check entrance signs before photographing any artwork.","short_summary":"A free cultural stop connecting the college with Lakeland’s wider community.","evidence_claim":"The museum states that general admission is free and lists regular Saturday hours from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM.","source_url":"https://agbmuseum.org/faq","source_title":"Frequently Asked Questions — The Ashley Gibson Barnett Museum of Art","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Regular Saturday hours are 10:00 AM–4:00 PM. Photography is allowed in many galleries, but visitors must follow gallery signs.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lakeland-hollis-garden","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Hollis Garden","title":"Saturday Late Afternoon: Walk Hollis Garden","subtitle":"Add a city garden to the campus-focused day","notes":"Walk the formal beds and fountains at an unhurried pace, respect any rental closure, and leave enough time to exit before closing.","short_summary":"A structured botanical walk within Lakeland’s historic Lake Mirror Park.","evidence_claim":"The City of Lakeland describes Hollis Garden as a 1.2-acre botanical display garden in Lake Mirror Park with patterned beds, public art, fountains, and more than 10,000 flowers.","source_url":"https://www.lakelandgov.net/hollisgarden","source_title":"Hollis Garden | City of Lakeland","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"June–August hours are 10:00 AM–6:00 PM Tuesday–Sunday; the garden is closed Mondays. Friday and Saturday rentals may affect access after 6:00 PM.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fsc-roux-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Roux Library","title":"Sunday Evening: Set Up Your Study Base","subtitle":"Finish the weekend by locating library resources","notes":"Find a preferred study zone, save the librarian contact details, and identify the café and group areas before classes begin.","short_summary":"A low-pressure orientation to the campus’s main research and study facility.","evidence_claim":"Florida Southern says Roux Library provides extensive research resources, librarian appointments, group-study seating, meeting rooms, and casual seating.","source_url":"https://www.flsouthern.edu/library/about","source_title":"About Roux Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Posted summer hours currently show Sunday closed; academic-term hours may differ. Consult the library’s live hours before making this the Sunday stop.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Campus dining, library, technology-center, museum, waterfront, and garden schedules vary by academic term, summer season, holidays, or special events; verify the linked pages before setting out.","The Waterfront is limited to eligible FSC community members and requires an FSC ID, waiver, and compliance with safety rules.","The Water Dome is for viewing only unless Florida Southern expressly authorizes entry during an official event."]}],"warnings":[]}
